    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya hayo mfalme Nahashi wa Waamori akafa, na mwanawe aliyeitwa Hanuni akawa mfalme badala ya baba yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Daudi akasema, “Nitamtendea wema Hanuni, mwana wa Nahashi kama baba yake alivyonitendea.” Hivyo, Daudi alituma wajumbe kumpelekea salamu za rambirambi. Nao wajumbe wa Daudi walipofika katika nchi ya Waamori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakuu wa Waamori walimwambia bwana wao, Hanuni, “Je, unadhani kwamba Daudi kwa kukutumia watu wa kukufariji anamheshimu baba yako? Je, Daudi hakuwatuma watu hawa kwako ili kuuchunguza na kuupeleleza mji halafu wauteke?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Hanuni aliwachukua wajumbe hao wa Daudi akamnyoa kila mmoja nusu ya ndevu zake, akayapasua mavazi yao katikati mpaka matakoni, kisha akawaacha waende zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliona aibu mno kurudi nyumbani. Daudi alipopashwa habari alituma watu kuwalaki kwani hao wajumbe waliona aibu sana. Naye mfalme aliwaambia, “Kaeni mjini Yeriko, hata mtakapoota ndevu, kisha mrudi nyumbani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waamoni walipoona kuwa wamemchukiza Daudi, walikodi wanajeshi Waaramu 20,000 waendao kwa miguu, kutoka Beth-rehobu na Soba; wanajeshi 12,000, kutoka Tobu, na mfalme Maaka akiwa na wanajeshi 1,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi aliposikia habari hizo, alimtuma Yoabu kwenda na jeshi lote la mashujaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waamoni walitoka na kujipanga tayari kwa vita kwenye lango la mji wa Raba, mji wao mkuu; nao Waaramu kutoka Soba na Rehobu na watu kutoka Tobu na Maaka walijipanga nyikani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu alipoona kuwa vita ni vikali dhidi yake, mbele na nyuma, aliwateua baadhi ya wanajeshi Waisraeli hodari zaidi akawapanga kukabiliana na Waaramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wale wanajeshi wengine waliobaki aliwaweka chini ya uongozi wa ndugu yake Abishai, naye akawapanga ili wakabiliane na Waamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu akamwambia Abishai, “Ikiwa Waaramu wananizidi nguvu, utanisaidia lakini kama Waamoni wanakuzidi nguvu, nitakuja kukusaidia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini jipe moyo! Tupigane kiume kwa ajili ya watu wetu na kwa ajili ya miji ya Mungu wetu; naye Mwenyezi-Mungu atutendee lile analoona ni jema kwake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Yoabu na watu wake walisonga mbele kwenda kupigana na Waaramu, nao Waaramu walikimbia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waamoni walipoona kuwa Waaramu wamekimbia, nao pia walimkimbia Abishai na kuingia mjini. Yoabu akaacha kupigana na Waamoni, akarudi Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Waaramu walipoona kwamba wameshindwa na Waisraeli, walijikusanya pamoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadadezeri aliagiza Waaramu waliokuwa ngambo ya mto Eufrate waletwe, wapelekwe huko Helamu wakiongozwa na Shobaki kamanda wa jeshi la Hadadezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alipopata habari, aliwakusanya pamoja Waisraeli wote, akavuka mto Yordani na kwenda mpaka Helamu. Nao Waaramu walijipanga tayari kwa vita dhidi ya Daudi, wakaanza kupigana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Waaramu walikimbia mbele ya Waisraeli. Daudi aliwaua Waaramu 700 waliokuwa madereva wa magari ya vita, wapandafarasi 40,000. Pia alimwumiza Shobaki kamanda wa jeshi lao, naye akafia papo hapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha wafalme wote waliokuwa watumishi wa Hadadezeri walipoona kuwa wameshindwa na Waisraeli, walifanya mapatano ya amani na Israeli, nao wakawa watumishi wa Israeli. Hivyo Waaramu hawakuthubutu kuwasaidia Waamoni tena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
